#27713
Forest of Turra / Village of Turra -1~
So you really want to be the master of Turra and Everwar?  Then you must know
the land well.  Do you?  Then prove it.  Venture into the Forest of Turra and
find the Turrian soldier that stands out.  He'll look out of place.  Defeat him
in a contest of strength!  There are elves hidden in the forest.  Find and slay
one of the elven defenders.  After that head to the Village of Turra and find
the field workers.
~
In the Forest of Turra find the Turrian soldier and the elven defender.  Also locate the field workers north of the Village of Turra.
~
